From 4901cd485955e6985c42025ff9d24acbe6c8a6a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: virtualAxe <virtualaxe@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 12:37:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 06/13] virtual mining: precompute nonce search material

Why: precompute reusable SHA-256 header material so guest-side nonce search can
make progress under QEMU without moving proof-of-work to the host.
Virtual-only: all changes are inside the virtual ASIC search implementation.
Upstream surface: virtual ASIC header cache, SHA compression helpers, and
candidate diff calculation.
Verify: run make verify-submit-replay and verify-test-ci.
Removal impact: low-difficulty guest mining becomes too slow for reliable local
and remote submit evidence.

---
 components/asic/virtual_asic.c | 166 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 157 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

